                      'product -> economicTerms -> payout as PerformancePayout exists',
                      'Rosetta condition PerformancePayout_ExtraordinaryDividendsParty '
                      'is not stated in LinkML: if product -> economicTerms -> payout '
                      'as PerformancePayout -> returnTerms -> dividendReturnTerms -> '
                      'extraordinaryDividendsParty exists then ancillaryParty -> role '
                      'contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> ExtraordinaryDividendsParty and '
                      'if ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> '
                      'ExtraordinaryDividendsParty then product -> economicTerms -> '
